title: Oxlint
description: Fast lint beside semantic Tailwind rewrites.
---

```json
{
  "scripts": {
    "check": "tailwind-canonicalize . --check && oxlint ."
  }
}
```

Oxlint is a reporter; keep rewrites on the canonicalize CLI. Jobs can run in parallel in CI.
